    doc.append('1. **The Three Fundamental Roles of Ultrasound:**')
    doc.append('   - **Pre-cannulation Assessment:** Identifying vessel anatomy, patency (compressibility and absence of intraluminal thrombus), depth, diameter, respiratory variability, and anatomical anomalies (e.g., vessel transposition, bifurcation variations, or overlap with adjacent arteries).')
