    doc.append('')
    doc.append('2. **Technical Modalities & Ergonomics:**')
    doc.append('   - **Transducer Alignment:** Use of short-axis (SAX, transverse, out-of-plane) approach for lateral centering and side-to-side orientation, combined with dynamic needle tip positioning (DNTP), or long-axis (LAX, longitudinal, in-plane) approach for complete needle and shaft trajectory visualization.')
    doc.append('   - **Ergonomic Configuration:** In-line orientation where the operator, puncture site, ultrasound transducer, and ultrasound screen are situated in a single direct visual axis, eliminating head-turning and disorientation.')
    doc.append('   - **Color and Spectral Doppler:** Indispensable adjuncts to distinguish non-pulsatile vs pulsatile waveforms and confirm non-occlusive thrombi when compression alone is inconclusive.')
