    doc.append('')
    doc.append('A multidisciplinary writing committee comprising adult and pediatric echocardiographers, anesthesiologists, cardiologists, vascular surgeons, interventional radiologists, and sonographers conducted a comprehensive literature search across PubMed, EMBASE, and the Cochrane Library. The review focused on randomized controlled trials (RCTs), prospective cohort studies, systematic reviews, and meta-analyses published through 2024 evaluating ultrasound guidance versus landmark-guided or fluoroscopic vascular access.')
    doc.append('')
    doc.append('Recommendations were established using the **Grading of Recommendations Assessment, Development and Evaluation (GRADE)** framework, assessing the balance of benefits versus risks, the quality of supporting evidence, and clinical implications.')
