    doc.append('| **1B** | Strong recommendation | Moderate-quality evidence | Benefits clearly outweigh risk | Evidence from RCTs with minor limitations (inconsistent results, indirectness, imprecision) or very strong observational evidence. Further research may impact confidence. Applies to most patients. Clinicians should follow unless justified otherwise. |')
